{{Quote|We know that fans of ''Star Wars'' value the feeling of immersion — of being transported into the ''Star Wars'' galaxy and moving through richly-detailed environments. It's fun to imagine what the team at Massive can do within ''Star Wars'' by bringing their innovative spirit and their commitment to quality.|Douglas Reilly, VP of Lucasfilm Games|<ref name="Interview">{{SW|url=news/lucasfilm-games-interview|text=Lucasfilm Games Hits Lightspeed Toward the Future}}</ref>}}
'''''Star Wars Outlaws''''' is an open-world video game developed by [[Massive Entertainment]] and published by [[Ubisoft]] in collaboration with [[Lucasfilm Games]]. The game is story-driven, features an open world, and utilizes Massive Entertainment's proprietary [[Wikipedia:Snowdrop (game engine)|Snowdrop]] game engine.

''Outlaws'' centers on [[Kay Vess]], a [[slicer]] and [[thief]] from [[Canto Bight]] who crosses the [[Zerek Besh]] crime syndicate, leading to her becoming entangled in the criminal underworld's ongoing [[Syndicate War]]. The outlaw [[Jaylen Vrax]] and his [[BX-series droid commando]] [[ND-5]] recruit Vess to build a [[Kay Vess' crew|crew]] to reattempt a heist against Zerek Besh's leader [[Sliro Barsha|Sliro Ruback]], so Vess travels with her [[merqaal]] companion [[Nix]] and ND-5 to the [[planet]]s [[Akiva]], [[Tatooine]] and [[Kijimi]] in order to find the right crew.

The game was released early on [[August 27]], [[2024]] to players who either pre-ordered the Gold Edition or Ultimate Edition of the game or to those using [[Wikipedia:Ubisoft+|Ubisoft+]], the publisher's subscription service.<ref name="Ubisoft Plus" /> Otherwise, the game was released on [[August 30]], 2024 for most modern platforms,<ref name="Story trailer" /> with it becoming available through [[Wikipedia:Steam (service)|Steam]] on [[November 21]], 2024<ref name="FAQ">{{Ubisoft|url=en-us/game/star-wars/outlaws/news-updates/2IR062oHAAtJNmnlj34wsM/faq|text=FAQ}}</ref> and [[Wikipedia:Nintendo Switch 2|Nintendo Switch 2]] on [[September 4]], [[2025]].<ref name="Switch 2" /> The game's Season Pass was announced before it launched and came with exclusive cosmetics, the exclusive mission "Jabba's Gambit," which was available at launch, and the two then-upcoming story expansions. ''Wild Card'', the first story pack, was released on November 21, 2024<ref name="Wild Card released" /> and ''A Pirate's Fortune'', the second story pack, was released on [[May 15]], 2025.<ref name="Pirates Fortune released" />
